{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Punch in. Let the madness begin.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're the sole toll booth operator on a remote desert highway. At first, it\u2019s routine: press the button, lift the gate, collect the cash.<br>But routine doesn\u2019t last long out here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You plant strange seeds. You grow bizarre fruit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soon, you're mixing cocktails and <strong>selling drinks</strong> to whoever rolls up to the gate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run your station. Grow your crops. Cook. Serve. Survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/dd859c9612aa824efd83b6ca46f50c28.poster.avif?t=1753774584\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/dd859c9612aa824efd83b6ca46f50c28.webm?t=1753774584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/dd859c9612aa824efd83b6ca46f50c28.mp4?t=1753774584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage traffic through your toll gate. Accept payment, deny weirdos, or let them through just to see what happens. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/0508caa9f92ec5f4182f2a3ee6b14809.poster.avif?t=1753774584\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/0508caa9f92ec5f4182f2a3ee6b14809.webm?t=1753774584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/0508caa9f92ec5f4182f2a3ee6b14809.mp4?t=1753774584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plant exotic seeds. Harvest the fruits of your labor.\u00a0<strong>Mix and sell cocktails</strong> with unpredictable and often alarming side effects. Some customers come back for more. Others don\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/2dd5bf916cabf2ed80340974c4c5e0ae.poster.avif?t=1753774584\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/2dd5bf916cabf2ed80340974c4c5e0ae.webm?t=1753774584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/2dd5bf916cabf2ed80340974c4c5e0ae.mp4?t=1753774584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Farm your ingredients.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plant exotic seeds, water them with a tractor, and harvest bizarre fruits from mutating trees. Everything you need for the drinks... or something else entirely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/566bb9afbac552ebbb66c1b620487808.poster.avif?t=1753774584\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/566bb9afbac552ebbb66c1b620487808.webm?t=1753774584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/566bb9afbac552ebbb66c1b620487808.mp4?t=1753774584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Break into houses, grab valuables, and escape before the sirens catch up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some loot is worth the risk. Some\u2026 not so much.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebac